# 🚀 Day 42 – Personal Financial Command Center

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 42** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **💰 Personal Financial Command Center**, a premium interactive financial dashboard designed to help users understand, manage, and improve their financial health.

Instead of functioning as a basic expense tracker, this application provides a complete financial command center with budgeting, investments, cash flow analysis, financial planning, AI-powered insights, and interactive visualizations—all inside a **single offline HTML application**.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Build a modern financial dashboard that empowers users to:

- Track financial health
- Understand spending habits
- Plan savings and investments
- Manage debt and loans
- Simulate future financial scenarios
- Make smarter financial decisions using data-driven insights

